{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;<strong>CREATION OF THE GODS</strong>&quot;</i> stands as a masterpiece of Chinese mythological literature, a widely beloved classical novel set against the Shang-Zhou dynastic war. It paints a grand celestial tapestry through Jiang Ziya's divine mission, intertwining the fates of immortals and mortal warriors. Blending profound Daoist philosophy with dazzling fantasy\u2014magical artifacts, divine formations, and mythical creatures\u2014the novel's romantic imagination endows it with timeless legendary appeal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATION OF THE GODS: The Classic Pixel JRPG Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of highlights from the original novel\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 30: INCIDENTS LEADING TO A REBELLION; Chapter 31: FLIGHT AND PURSUIT; Chapter 32: HUANG TIANHUA MEETS HIS FATHER; Chapter 33: THE BATTLE AT SISHUI PASS; Chapter 34: HUANG FEIHU MEETS THE PRIME MINISTER\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/86b0aa163eb18aa924e478dd18942c06.avif?t=1762168460\" width=616 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Classic single-narrative gameplay blending strategy and exploration!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Fully handcrafted pixel art featuring characters, mythical beasts, divine artifacts, and immersive scenes!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Classic Gameplay System\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Multi-faceted Narrative: In-Scene &amp; World Map Storytelling, Plus Combat Integration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/6853d7989e665bbcb4ad1dd923d1415a.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=720 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/6853d7989e665bbcb4ad1dd923d1415a.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/6853d7989e665bbcb4ad1dd923d1415a.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We deliver a complete and cohesive story through various narrative approaches. Within the game, plot development is advanced via <strong>rich character dialogue and pivotal events</strong>. Additionally, the <strong>combat itself serves as a narrative element</strong>, incorporating <strong>performance sequences</strong> during key battles. These sequences utilize <strong>lively animations and dynamic camera work</strong> to convey story progression and characters' emotional states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/ebe1e61ad10f5b7d2b0b4d9c0d93fb4c.avif?t=1762168460\" width=616 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Explore Levels Freely:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover chests, search environments, and converse with NPCs for clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/56118331a0e28844f9cc756020e99fdd.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/56118331a0e28844f9cc756020e99fdd.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/56118331a0e28844f9cc756020e99fdd.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Wu Xing: Generation and Overcoming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental system based on the cycle of creation and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/613e89abd0e8961c316dafd9517c99f3.avif?t=1762168460\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Gain Levels Through Combat:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat beasts and monsters to earn experience and unlock new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/daf77365e2e3b260d1e38cdcf5afe6d1.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=640 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/daf77365e2e3b260d1e38cdcf5afe6d1.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/daf77365e2e3b260d1e38cdcf5afe6d1.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Craft Useful Items:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to synthesize useful combat gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Challenge Boss Guardians!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your party formation to face guardian BOSS and advance the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/64d759f70e8509573ba7cec749a3e66e.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/64d759f70e8509573ba7cec749a3e66e.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/64d759f70e8509573ba7cec749a3e66e.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Wield Powerful Artifacts!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master potent magical artifacts to deliver decisive blows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/1ce040605ba1045ee12d0ba2ca3bef79.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/1ce040605ba1045ee12d0ba2ca3bef79.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/1ce040605ba1045ee12d0ba2ca3bef79.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908250?t=1762168460","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/e9057b6ea7099da2c80108a263a232008fe38f3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762168460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/67e366d47e5c753fc1ad5d7af0cfe202a72a81f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762168460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/67e366d47e5c753fc1ad5d7af0cfe202a72a81f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762168460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4050140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Play the English Demo!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/d03987726b1af25bae55a4d082207afe.avif?t=1762168460\" width=616 height=224 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great news, everyone! We are proud to release the English-localized Demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now download and experience the first chapter of our story! Please leave feedback in the Discussions and report any issues you find.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;<strong>CREATION OF THE GODS</strong>&quot;</i> stands as a masterpiece of Chinese mythological literature, a widely beloved classical novel set against the Shang-Zhou dynastic war. It paints a grand celestial tapestry through Jiang Ziya's divine mission, intertwining the fates of immortals and mortal warriors. Blending profound Daoist philosophy with dazzling fantasy\u2014magical artifacts, divine formations, and mythical creatures\u2014the novel's romantic imagination endows it with timeless legendary appeal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATION OF THE GODS: The Classic Pixel JRPG Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of highlights from the original novel\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 30: INCIDENTS LEADING TO A REBELLION; Chapter 31: FLIGHT AND PURSUIT; Chapter 32: HUANG TIANHUA MEETS HIS FATHER; Chapter 33: THE BATTLE AT SISHUI PASS; Chapter 34: HUANG FEIHU MEETS THE PRIME MINISTER\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/86b0aa163eb18aa924e478dd18942c06.avif?t=1762168460\" width=616 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Classic single-narrative gameplay blending strategy and exploration!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Fully handcrafted pixel art featuring characters, mythical beasts, divine artifacts, and immersive scenes!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Classic Gameplay System\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Multi-faceted Narrative: In-Scene &amp; World Map Storytelling, Plus Combat Integration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/6853d7989e665bbcb4ad1dd923d1415a.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=720 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/6853d7989e665bbcb4ad1dd923d1415a.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/6853d7989e665bbcb4ad1dd923d1415a.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We deliver a complete and cohesive story through various narrative approaches. Within the game, plot development is advanced via <strong>rich character dialogue and pivotal events</strong>. Additionally, the <strong>combat itself serves as a narrative element</strong>, incorporating <strong>performance sequences</strong> during key battles. These sequences utilize <strong>lively animations and dynamic camera work</strong> to convey story progression and characters' emotional states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/ebe1e61ad10f5b7d2b0b4d9c0d93fb4c.avif?t=1762168460\" width=616 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Explore Levels Freely:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover chests, search environments, and converse with NPCs for clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/56118331a0e28844f9cc756020e99fdd.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/56118331a0e28844f9cc756020e99fdd.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/56118331a0e28844f9cc756020e99fdd.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Wu Xing: Generation and Overcoming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental system based on the cycle of creation and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/613e89abd0e8961c316dafd9517c99f3.avif?t=1762168460\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Gain Levels Through Combat:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat beasts and monsters to earn experience and unlock new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/daf77365e2e3b260d1e38cdcf5afe6d1.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=640 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/daf77365e2e3b260d1e38cdcf5afe6d1.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/daf77365e2e3b260d1e38cdcf5afe6d1.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Craft Useful Items:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to synthesize useful combat gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Challenge Boss Guardians!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your party formation to face guardian BOSS and advance the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/64d759f70e8509573ba7cec749a3e66e.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/64d759f70e8509573ba7cec749a3e66e.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/64d759f70e8509573ba7cec749a3e66e.mp4?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Wield Powerful Artifacts!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master potent magical artifacts to deliver decisive blows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/1ce040605ba1045ee12d0ba2ca3bef79.poster.avif?t=1762168460\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/1ce040605ba1045ee12d0ba2ca3bef79.webm?t=1762168460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/1ce040605ba104